                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Notice of British Opium Traffic Regulations,
                    1924</hi></head>
                <p>The following Regulations made by His Britannic Majesty’s Political Resident in
                    the Persian Gulf and allowed by His Majesty’s Secretary of State for Foreign
                    Affairs is published for general information.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Lieutenant-Colonel</hi></signed>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">His Britannic
                        Majesty’s Political Resident in the Persian Gulf.</hi></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bushire.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
